"A Colorado well permit, with the well built under it."
type DwrWellPermit {
	"As Built Aquifers."
	asBuiltAquifers: String
	"Associated Aquifers."
	associatedAquifers: String
	"Water court case number(s) associated with water right."
	associatedCaseNumbers: String
	"""
	Possible associated uses: Augmentation - Replacement supply; must include the associated plan of augmentation in
	the GROUP. Commercial - Ordinary non-manufacturing business such as hotels, campgrounds, retail stores,
	restaurants and stock yards. Dewatering Domestic - Residential use for inside uses and lawn and garden
	irrigation; see also “H”, for household use only diversion records. Fire - As needed for emergencies or
	training. Fishery - Generally non-consumptive (except evaporation) where only use is production of fish.
	Geothermal - Nonconsumptive, thermal energy exchange. Household use only - Generally associated with single
	dwelling, exempt wells; no uses outside the home or for more than basic sanitary and residential consumption.
	Industrial - Manufacturing, mining, steam production, etc. Irrigation - Application of water for the growth of
	beneficial vegetation.
	"""
	associatedUses: String
	"Depth from surface to bottom of perforated casing (feet)."
	bottomPerforatedCasing: Int
	"Contact Address."
	contactAddress: String
	"Contact City."
	contactCity: String
	"Contact Name."
	contactName: String
	"Contact Postal Code."
	contactPostalCode: String
	"Contact State Or Province."
	contactStateOrProvince: String
	"Contact Type."
	contactType: String
	"Distance and direction from East/West section line (feet)."
	coordsEw: Int
	"Direction of measurement from East/West section line."
	coordsEwDir: String
	"Distance and direction from North/South section line (feet)."
	coordsNs: Int
	"Direction of measurement from North/South section line."
	coordsNsDir: String
	"The county, in capitals, for example DENVER."
	county: String
	"Date of First Beneficial Use."
	date1stBeneficialUse: String
	"Date Application Received."
	dateApplicationReceived: String
	"Date Permit Expires."
	datePermitExpires: String
	"Date Permit Issued."
	datePermitIssued: String
	"Date Pump Installed."
	datePumpInstalled: String
	"Date Well Completed."
	dateWellCompleted: String
	"Date Well Plugged."
	dateWellPlugged: String
